# NanoOS dedicated Zen 5 build profile example.
# Use only inside an isolated Zen 5 package build environment.
# Do NOT install this as a global makepkg.conf on generic systems.

CFLAGS="-O2 -pipe -march=znver5"
CXXFLAGS="${CFLAGS}"

# Keep LTO, fast-math, and other aggressive transformations disabled
# until each package has specific correctness and performance evidence.
